      "She usually went with her mother.",
      "They saw many other interesting shops.",
      "One shop had a beautiful Hindu god statue.",
      "The eighteenth item, a small pot, was from the nineteenth century.",
      "The fortieth stall sold ninety old books, most from the twentieth century.",
      "Kaya bought two small bells, the twenty-second and thirtieth.",
      "Each bell had thirteen small designs and cost fifty yen.",
      "The fiftieth, sixtieth, and seventieth shops sold eighty colorful scarves.",
      "\"Please do not touch the fabric,\" her mother said, buying fourteen.",
      "At the end of the night, they took nine home together."
    ]
  }
}